      "side": 1,
      "message": "Including the label in the comparison will yield the wrong answer if only the label changes. Let\u0027s say the operator changes: label 1000 → 2000, prefix stays 10.0.0.0/24. The method returns True, but should be False. The new advertisement for 10.0.0.0/24 already replaces the old one and rebinds the label. Nothing is left stranded, so there is nothing to withdraw. Also the path-id can probably be dropped as well. Since this is only called on an in-place modification the before and after will always share the same path-id.",
      "revId": "3ca524c809676d354163b8dff6607f540664d839",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
